---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | Overlake Family Dentistry" description="How Overlake Family Dentistry handles website data and privacy.">
  <section class="container-page section max-w-3xl mx-auto prose prose-lg text-navy/80">
    <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold mt-3">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>The website itself does not collect personal health information. Contact-form submissions include name, email, phone, and message.</p>
    <h2>Analytics & cookies</h2>
    <p>We use analytics only after you accept via our cookie banner. No non-essential trackers run until then.</p>
    <h2>How to reach us</h2>
    <p>Questions about privacy? Call us or use the Contact page.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
